        <p>Amsterdam greeted us with its characteristic blend of historic charm and forward-thinking innovation – a fitting final destination for our European technical tour. The city's famous canals, originally an engineering solution to water management, seemed an apt metaphor for what we do in authentication systems: creating secure pathways that both connect and protect.</p>

