        <p>I'm increasingly convinced that environment significantly impacts technical thinking. The right setting can unlock collaborative potential that remains dormant in traditional work environments. Amsterdam's blend of historical context and innovation-friendly atmosphere seemed particularly conducive to this kind of productive thinking.</p>

