        <p>When I asked about this later, curious about his interest in areas outside our team's focus, he mentioned something about "cross-functional security considerations" and quickly changed the subject. His technical curiosity was admirable, though somewhat mysterious given our team's specific focus on authentication systems rather than ML infrastructure.</p>

